{\b Touch Deck}\par
Companion app for the Touch Deck boards (RP2040-Touch-LCD-1.69 and ESP32-2424S012C).\par
It connects to the board over USB serial, sends it text to type, and, in PC output mode, performs the board's keyboard and mouse input on this computer.\par
\par
Installs for the current user only, in %LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Touch Deck. Settings are kept in %APPDATA%\\TouchDeck. Clip history is never written to disk.\par
\par
